<para>AHP-09: Simulated <ref refid="ldap__connection__pool_8h_1ae1d91d802fce48f28cb3fa636dc5bc1e" kindref="member">LDAP</ref> bind path — mutex + string comparison overhead.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.0.13 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Score: 86/100 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Status: Production Ready </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>This block is auto-generated and will be overwritten.</para>
</simplesect>
This benchmark measures the pure in-process overhead of the <ref refid="ldap__connection__pool_8h_1ae1d91d802fce48f28cb3fa636dc5bc1e" kindref="member">LDAP</ref> connection pool checkout path when the pool is at capacity but the lock-path executes immediately (using a minimal pool config with pre-populated idle connections).</para>
<para>Tagged with bench_auth_protocol_micro.</para>
<para>NOTE: No real <ref refid="ldap__connection__pool_8h_1ae1d91d802fce48f28cb3fa636dc5bc1e" kindref="member">LDAP</ref> server is contacted. The benchmark exercises the in-memory pool data-structure path only.</para>
